<title>SPAIN: Spanish bonds end bit higher, peseta jumps ahead.</title>
<headline>Spanish bonds end bit higher, peseta jumps ahead.</headline>
<text>
<p>1520 GMT - Government bonds closed a little higher but off highs in dull Wednesday session, helped by a stronger peseta</p>
<p>* 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 107.73 vs 107.64, yield 6.26 vs 6.27</p>
<p>* Sept bond future 117.32 vs 117.24 at yesterday's close</p>
<p>* Peseta/mark 84.12/15 vs 84.27/28</p>
